  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Mail: MailDispatcher (template resolution, bulk send, debug redirect, mail history with optional per-recipient detail rows), MailBulkSearch (server-side recipient resolution from a list search condition), MailPreviewBuilder (dry-run preview rendered as a self-contained HTML file; bulk preview lists excluded recipients with the reason and highlights resolved variables), Gmail API sender with per-user OAuth tokens (GmailUserTokenStore / GmailTokenHelper), MailCurrentUserResolver. Only the Gmail sender is public in this release; custom infrastructures implement IMailSender. BREAKING: SmtpMailService is removed. Approval flow: ApprovalEngine (server-side validation and execution of every state transition, optimistic locking, turn notification mail). Bulk file transfer: BulkFileTransfer.BulkSubmitAsync / GetListFileByDataAsync(Stream) helpers for the template controllers.",
